sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Ctrl as ModelService Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant CM as BaseConfig ConfigMap
    participant Tmpl as Template Engine<br/>(Sprig)
    participant Merge as Merge Layer<br/>(Mergo)

    Note over User,Merge: Flow 1: ModelService Reconciliation

    User->>K8s: kubectl apply ModelService CR<br/>(llm-d.ai/v1alpha1)
    K8s-->>Ctrl: Watch event: ModelService created/updated<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token

    Ctrl->>K8s: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    K8s-->>Ctrl: ConfigMap data (serialized K8s manifests)

    Ctrl->>Tmpl: Interpolate template variables<br/>(ModelServiceName, InferencePoolName, ...)
    Tmpl-->>Ctrl: Resolved manifests

    Ctrl->>Merge: Merge BaseConfig + ModelService spec<br/>(containerSliceTransformer,<br/>envVarSliceTransformer,<br/>parentRefSliceTransformer,<br/>backendRefTransformer)
    Merge-->>Ctrl: Merged resource specs

    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE Prefill Deployment<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE Decode Deployment<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE EPP Deployment + Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE HTTPRoute<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE InferencePool CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE InferenceModel CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: CREATE/UPDATE ServiceAccount + RoleBinding<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: UPDATE ModelService status<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA token

    Note over User,Merge: Flow 2: Inference Traffic (managed workloads)

    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>(via HTTPRoute)
    participant EPP as EPP Service<br/>(Endpoint Picker)
    participant Prefill as Prefill Pods
    participant Decode as Decode Pods
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Client->>GW: Inference request<br/>(port/protocol per BaseConfig)
    GW->>EPP: Route via InferencePool<br/>(port/protocol per BaseConfig)
    EPP->>Prefill: Forward to prefill pods<br/>(intelligent routing)
    EPP->>Decode: Forward to decode pods<br/>(intelligent routing)

    Note right of Prefill: Model loading at startup
    Prefill->>HF: Download model (hf:// URI)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>Prefill: Model artifacts
    Decode->>HF: Download model (hf:// URI)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>Decode: Model artifacts

    Decode-->>EPP: Inference response
    EPP-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: Final response
